OL,3,A'It's like you're in one of his
OL,4,Apaintings' Kyffin Williams' art brought
OL,5,Ato life
OL,6,
OL,7,FFor the first time, the paintings of
OL,8,FSir Kyffin Williams have been brought
OL,9,Fto life in a new immersive experience
OL,10,Fat the National Library of Wales.
OL,12,FTechnology similar to that used for
OL,13,Fexhibitions of Van Gogh, Cezanne and LS
OL,14,FLowry will immerse visitors in the
OL,15,Fmountain landscapes, hillfarms and
OL,16,Fstormy seas created by the painter, who
OL,17,Fis considered the defining Welsh artist
OL,18,Fof the 20th Century.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,169,160,200,105,0,100
