OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'It's like you're in one of his
OL,4,Apaintings' Kyffin Williams' art brought
OL,5,Ato life
OL,6,
OL,7,FImages from Williams's oil paintings
OL,8,Fsuch as the hill farmer and sheepdog
OL,9,Fare animated in a 360-degree
OL,10,Fcentrepiece and Sir Kyffin's life story
OL,11,Fis narrated by Sir Bryn Terfel in a
OL,12,Fbilingual presentation, with original
OL,13,Fpaintings illuminated on the walls.
OL,15,FThe National Library, which received
OL,16,Fgrants of #500,000 to fund the project,
OL,17,Fsaid it hoped it will introduce a new
OL,18,Faudience to Sir Kyffin's work.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
